  "details": "If a timeout occurs in VRChat, the following error log will be output and instance rejoining will be performed automatically.\n\n---------\n\n2023.05.29 04:33:37 Error      -  [Behaviour] {{ NameServerAddress: 'ns.photonengine.io:5058', MasterServerAddress: '91.199.81.50:5055', GameServerAddress: '91.199.81.49:5056', Code: 'ServerTimeout', State: 'Disconnected', Time: '-122058.465' }}\n\n2023.05.29 04:33:37 Log        -  [Behaviour] Disconnected: ServerTimeout with Reason: \n\n2023.05.29 04:33:37 Log        -  [Behaviour] Resetting game flow because \"VRChat is not responding.\": [RejoinInstance, SkipLogin]\n\n---------\n\nHowever, with high frequency in the current version, the instance termination process is interrupted.\n\n(The interruption of the termination process seems to occur at a specific time, right after deleting all players.)\n\nWhen this glitch occurs, you are left in an instance with no players (and no avatar of your own).\n\nThe VRChat in-game menu becomes inoperable and the only solution is to force-quit VRChat.",
